{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14825","headline":"敬詶大府二十四舅览诗卷因以见示 · 卢纶","name":"敬詶大府二十四舅览诗卷因以见示","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郄公怜戆亦怜愚，忽赠金盘径寸珠。\n彻底碧潭滋涸溜，压枝红艳照枯株。\n九门洞啓延高论，百辟联行挹大儒。\n顾己文章非酷似，敢将幽劣俟洪炉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14825.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14825","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}